      <section class="slide metrics" id="slide-4" aria-label="4. Decision Metrics">
        <p class="eyebrow">Decision Metrics</p>
        <h2>Are you making the decisions that matter?</h2>
        <div class="metrics-body">
          <ol class="dimensions" aria-label="Seven dimensions of decision quality, each on its own">
            <li><h3>Framing</h3><p>Was the right problem framed?</p></li>
            <li><h3>Alternatives</h3><p>Were real options weighed?</p></li>
            <li><h3>Information</h3><p>Was the relevant information gathered and used?</p></li>
            <li><h3>Reasoning</h3><p>Does the choice follow from the information?</p></li>
            <li><h3>Values / Tradeoffs</h3><p>Were the tradeoffs made explicit and weighed?</p></li>
            <li><h3>Bias exposure</h3><p>Anchoring, confirmation, sunk cost, motivated reasoning?</p></li>
            <li><h3>Calibration</h3><p>Did confidence match the evidence?</p></li>
